Apply this to .github/workflows/daily.yml under jobs.run-autonomous-agent.env:

      # Free, operator-owned source relays. Comma order is failover order:
      # Cloudflare Worker first, Google Apps Script second.
      EDGE_FACTORY_RELAY_URLS: ${{ secrets.EDGE_FACTORY_RELAY_URLS }}
      EDGE_FACTORY_RELAY_TOKEN: ${{ secrets.EDGE_FACTORY_RELAY_TOKEN }}

The GitHub App used by this repository cannot push workflow changes without the
workflows permission. Add these two lines in GitHub's web editor after creating
the matching Actions secrets.
